<title>CANADA: GM CANADA SALES RISE 20.9 PCT IN JULY.</title>
<headline>GM CANADA SALES RISE 20.9 PCT IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Wednesday its sales for July were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +20.9		   38,724	  32,041</p>
<p>   Cars	    +13.5		   22,050	  19,428</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +32.2		   16,674	  12,613</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +14.0		  265,890	  233,223</p>
<p>   Cars	    +12.3		  153,660	  136,848</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +16.5		  112,230	   96,375</p>
<p>(( Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
